01:17:50.490 --> 01:17:51.390
I don't know.

01:17:51.390 --> 01:17:52.580
That's Amazon's problem.

01:17:52.580 --> 01:17:54.810
Our systems are running
fairly stably though.

01:17:54.810 --> 01:17:57.170
Let's go take a look at NGINX.

01:17:57.170 --> 01:18:00.470
