containers where all

01:20:31.800 --> 01:20:34.100
of the services that
we're looking at today

01:20:34.100 --> 01:20:36.176
are running on
container technology.

01:20:36.176 --> 01:20:40.550
Kubernetes allows you to build
your services the same way

01:20:40.550 --> 01:20:44.700
to get to higher utilization,
higher redundancy,

01:20:44.700 --> 01:20:47.330
higher efficiency
across, no matter

01:20:47.330 --> 01:20:49.170
where you run that system.

01:20:49.170 --> 01:20:52.560
I'm really excited today to
