01:40:40.500 --> 01:40:43.765
But eventually, we have
more and more users.

01:40:43.765 --> 01:40:47.430
So how many concurrent users
do we have to consider?

01:40:47.430 --> 01:40:49.365
That's a second issue.

01:40:49.365 --> 01:40:50.795
BigQuery solved those problems.

