01:44:58.640 --> 01:45:00.250
So the next step
is to use a product

01:45:00.250 --> 01:45:02.380
from us called Cloud Data Flow.

01:45:02.380 --> 01:45:06.060
You can see in this user
interface we're consuming data,

01:45:06.060 --> 01:45:09.420
but we're also orchestrating
its distribution

01:45:09.420 --> 01:45:13.950
across not only BigQuery,
our query environment,

01:45:13.950 --> 01:45:18.490
but also, directly into GCS
for archival or later storage.

01:45:18.490 --> 01:45:22.550
And then we can even write
externally to some other HDFS.

01:45:22.550 --> 01:45:24.230
You saw the model from Recruit.

01:45:24.230 --> 01:45:25.770
They run lots of
