component of their production

01:51:16.950 --> 01:51:18.030
operation.

01:51:18.030 --> 01:51:18.530
Right?

01:51:18.530 --> 01:51:20.660
So there's almost
no Google service

01:51:20.660 --> 01:51:25.970
that isn't today powered in
some way by Machine Learning.

01:51:25.970 --> 01:51:26.770
Think about that.

01:51:26.770 --> 01:51:29.200
That's a huge change in
a short period of time.

01:51:29.200 --> 01:51:31.370
I mean, for example,
in search, everybody's

01:51:31.370 --> 01:51:33.810
used Google Search
before, I suspect.

01:51:33.810 --> 01:51:35.650
It is now the third signal.

01:51:35.650 --> 01:51:38.390
The third most important
signal in search

01:51:38.390 --> 01:51:40.660
comes from a Machine
Learning model about what's

01:51:40.660 --> 01:51:42.810
likely to be relevant to you.

01:51:42.810 --> 01:51:45.750
So we know that this is going
to make an enormous impact

01:51:45.750 --> 01:51:49.680
in every business across all
of the different categories

01:51:49.680 --> 01:51:53.100
of effort as you try to
understand and digest data.

01:51:53.100 --> 01:51:53.650
We know.

01:51:53.650 --> 01:51:54.980
We're sure.

01:51:54.980 --> 01:51:58.900
So we've taken some big steps
to bring this power to you,

01:51:58.900 --> 01:52:01.340
because we think it's
really what's next.

01:52:01.340 --> 01:52:04.410
So first, we've
pre-baked and built

01:52:04.410 --> 01:52:07.600
